==============================================================================
### 8a. lateral_modes: roll/spiral assignment sorts on tau, not on |tau|
==============================================================================

boeing747: real lateral eigenvalues = [-0.55698959 -0.00724415]
   taus = -1/lambda            = [  1.795366 138.042408]
   lateral_modes returns  roll_tau=1.795366  spiral_tau=138.042408
   FASTEST |tau| (physically the roll subsidence) = 1.795366 s

boeing747_approach: real lateral eigenvalues = [-1.21269133 -0.03677222]
   taus = -1/lambda            = [ 0.824612 27.194444]
   lateral_modes returns  roll_tau=0.824612  spiral_tau=27.194444
   FASTEST |tau| (physically the roll subsidence) = 0.824612 s

cherokee: real lateral eigenvalues = [-2.78142966  0.01938326]
   taus = -1/lambda            = [  0.359527 -51.5909  ]
   lateral_modes returns  roll_tau=-51.590900  spiral_tau=0.359527
   FASTEST |tau| (physically the roll subsidence) = 0.359527 s
   *** MISMATCH: `reals.sort()` sorts on the SIGNED tau, so an
       UNSTABLE spiral (tau<0) sorts first and is labelled 'roll'. ***

cessna172: real lateral eigenvalues = [-11.34124338  -0.06005444]
   taus = -1/lambda            = [ 0.088174 16.651559]
   lateral_modes returns  roll_tau=0.088174  spiral_tau=16.651559
   FASTEST |tau| (physically the roll subsidence) = 0.088174 s

==============================================================================
### 8b. ENERGY: a drag-free, thrust-free, moment-free aircraft
==============================================================================
Lift in body axes is [L sin a, 0, -L cos a] and vel_rel is
V[cos a cos b, sin b, sin a cos b]; the dot product is exactly zero, so
lift does NO work and KE+PE must be conserved.
  dt=0.02    n=50000    T=    1000 s   max|E-E0|/E0=1.4593e-11  final dE/E0=+1.4304e-11  alt span 3000.0..3121.5 m
  dt=0.02    n=500000   T=   10000 s   max|E-E0|/E0=1.4593e-11  final dE/E0=+1.4304e-11  alt span 3000.0..3121.5 m
  dt=0.002   n=500000   T=    1000 s   max|E-E0|/E0=5.7259e-13  final dE/E0=-5.7259e-13  alt span 3000.0..3121.5 m
