trim.ALPHA_LIMIT = 15.0 deg; `is_physical` checks alpha ONLY --
   elevator and throttle are unbounded in `trim.trim` and unchecked in `is_physical`.

density/temperature extrapolated BELOW sea level (a power-off run reached -3994 m):
   h=  -5000.0 m  T=320.650 K  p=177687.0 Pa  rho=1.930468 kg/m^3
   h=  -3994.0 m  T=314.111 K  p=159450.4 Pa  rho=1.768400 kg/m^3
