   the troposphere formula has T -> 0 at h = -44330.8 m

verification.fitted_order raises on a zero/negative error:
   ValueError: an error is zero or negative; the sequence is saturated

validation.modes_from_matrix drops any root with lam.imag <= 1e-9 (ABSOLUTE):
   a mode of frequency below 1e-9 rad/s would be silently reported as two reals.
   lateral_modes then does reals[0], reals[1] and would IndexError / mislabel.

Rankine core: one-sided d(w)/dr at r=r0 (ASSUMPTIONS E2 claims 2*V0/r0 jump)
   d(w_horiz)/d(z) inside  = -0.14166667 1/s
   d(w_horiz)/d(z) outside = +0.14166667 1/s
   jump = +0.28333333 1/s ;  2*v0/r0 = 0.28333333 1/s

state.quat_to_dcm does NOT normalise: det(DCM) for ||q||=1+d
   ||q||-1=0         det = 1.000000000000  (should be 1)
   ||q||-1=1e-08     det = 1.000000000000  (should be 1)
